  "ruleText": "Med 601.04 \"National certification\" means to hold a current physician assistant certificate issued by the National Commission on Certification of Physician Assistants (NCCPA).\n\nSource. #1497, eff 11-29-79; ss by #2199, eff 12-2-82; ss by #2197, eff 12-2-82; ss by #2910, eff 11-21-84; ss by #4745, eff 1-25-90, EXPIRED 1-25-96\n\nNew. #6472, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8678, eff 7-11-06, EXPIRED: 7-11-14\n\nNew. #10926, INTERIM, eff 9-4-15; ss by #11049, eff 3-2-16; ss by #13249, eff 8-6-21 (formerly Med 601.04); (formerly Med 601.03) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Med 600)",
